@startuml 04-ingestion-acl
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
title Ingestion and ACL lifecycle, per connector instance per cycle

participant "Connector\ninstance" as con
participant "Source" as src
participant "Pipeline\nparse, chunk, embed" as pipe
participant "Vector index\nQdrant" as vec
participant "Authz engine\nReBAC" as authz

loop every sync interval
  con -> src : list changes since cursor
  src --> con : new and changed docs plus ACLs
  con -> pipe : raw bytes plus ACL metadata
  pipe -> pipe : parse, contextual chunk, embed
  pipe -> vec : upsert chunks with tenant, group ids, acl_version
  pipe -> authz : write relationship tuples, doc to group to user
  con -> vec : delete removed docs
  con -> authz : revoke tuples on permission change
end

note over con, authz
Permission changes propagate by webhook where the source supports it.
Consistent doc ids link the vector payload and the authz graph.
A 429 from the source is surfaced so revocations are never silently delayed.
end note
@enduml
